        # band facts (law sec.4 W277 row): A = 1-HOP STAIRCASE-AFFECTS-A
        # walk TWENTY-SIXTH consecutive A-hop (the naive continuation
        # 624_501..626_500 REFUSED at naive start -- the registered W276 B band
